[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "二次審査も無事通ったぞ！\r\nおめでとう、恋鐘",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "004",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001030010,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "おお、やったばい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400103/7004001030010"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001030020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちも『W.I.N.G.』にまた一歩近づいたんやねー！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400103/7004001030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001030030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "よーし、この調子で予選はシュッ！　っと駆け抜けて……\r\nそんであっという間に優勝たい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400103/7004001030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな\r\n恋鐘が成長しているのは傍から見てもわかる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "前と比べて随分アイドルらしくなった\r\nこの調子なら本当に優勝かもな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001030040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふー\r\nプロデューサーもよくわかっとーね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400103/7004001030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001030050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "まあ、うちは天才やけん\r\n日々すごか速度で成長してるばい",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400103/7004001030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001030060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "けど、もっともっとよー！\r\nうちはまだこげなとこで止まってられんたい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400103/7004001030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001030070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "もっともーっと努力して\r\nたくさんの人にうちのアイドルっぷりを見てもらうたい！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400103/7004001030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、俺も恋鐘がどんなにすごいアイドルになるのか\r\n今から楽しみだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001030080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そ、そう？　プロデューサーもそう思うん？\r\nそうかぁ……んふふー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400103/7004001030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、俺も精一杯サポートしていくからな\r\nこれからも一緒に頑張ろう、恋鐘",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001030090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ、そんなに期待ばしてくれちょるなら\r\nうちもそれに応えんといかんねー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400103/7004001030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001030100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そうと決まれば\r\nばんばん練習してどんどん上手くならんと！",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400103/7004001030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001030110,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "よし、さっそくレッスンにいくばいー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400103/7004001030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ！　ちょっと待て恋鐘\r\nまだ連絡することが……",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……も、もういない\r\nやる気に満ち溢れてるな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001030120,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うおー！　やったるばいー！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400103/7004001030120"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]